<p local-id=3D"ed414dac-6d58-445b-b737-6f866c892f7b">This has been written =
up at <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://rtn-109.lsst.io/" rel=3D"n=
ofollow">RTN-109</a>, with updated numbers using DM-52836 data.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"5174effd-9aa9-4e2e-8b92-f3b1cf7697f1" id=3D"DRPResourceUsag=
eEstimates-1.1.DP2">1.1. DP2</h2>
<p local-id=3D"0525d660-d6a8-4103-a6b7-cd157224bfbb">These estimates use th=
e DRP.yaml pipeline definition in w_2025_41, and are based on resource usag=
e data from <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://rubinobs.atlassian.n=
et/browse/DM-52645" rel=3D"nofollow">DM-52645</a>. The input observations a=
re a selection of science observations using LSSTCam, extracted from the co=
nsolidated database (consdb). The query used for the selection is shown bel=
ow. For computing the number of datasets per dataset type and information s=
uch as the number of visits per patch per band, the <code>lsst_cells_v1</co=
de>skymap was used.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-1571882696" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1571882696" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"03fbc5efaf4ce050065d09c80269f81b450c23=
8eb1ba92445e86c437c8e8a295" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Storage by dataset type, no compression, 2025-10-1=
4 visit list</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1571882696" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 local-id=3D"e9ad964983f2" id=3D"DRPResourceUsageEstimates-1.1.1.Storage=
bydatasettype,nocompression,2025-10-14visitlist">1.1.1. Storage by dataset =
type, no compression, 2025-10-14 visit list</h3>
<p local-id=3D"fb7a5169-bed1-4225-94cd-e6afeb273517">There are 413 dataset =
types (dstype) in the w_2025_41 LSSTCam DRP pipeline. I=E2=80=99ve sorted t=
he entries below by total size for each dstype, and computed the cumulative=
 sizes and fractions. Below, I just show the top 20 entries, which add up t=
o ~96% of the 5.7 PB total.</p>
