<h3 local-id=3D"b99ae783-d792-42d2-8ce4-6d94ab5c322b" id=3D"DRPResourceUsag=
eEstimates-1.1.4.CPUtimebytask">1.1.4. CPU time by task</h3>
<p local-id=3D"95dd04e5-7beb-4abf-a41f-a753de69c994">Using estimates (descr=
ibed below) based on DRP performance in DM-52645, here are the CPU time req=
uirements for each task. The cpu times (in seconds) are weighted by the num=
ber of cores implied by the memory needs for each job. In the final column,=
 I=E2=80=99ve computed the =E2=80=9Ccumulative node days=E2=80=9D assuming =
120 cores per node, from the <code>cpu_time</code> column. The ordering of =
the rows is the nominal execution order of the tasks inferred from the LSST=
Cam DRP pipeline yaml.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8674771c-d226-4b6b-8be6-57a0c89bfc08">The total cpu time is =
~650 node days, so assuming we run at full capacity on 110 nodes at USDF, t=
