<h3 local-id=3D"b0bc74b1-42e1-4952-966d-8a091a88898c" id=3D"DRPResourceUsag=
eEstimates-1.1.5.DataSelection,2025-10-14">1.1.5. Data Selection, 2025-10-1=
4</h3>
<p local-id=3D"6444a2ff-4fca-48e9-ae4f-3f53312ab4d7">In the absence of an =
=E2=80=9Cofficial=E2=80=9D data selection, I made the following query to co=
nsdb to obtain the input observations for these calculations:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">select =
v.band, v.visit_id, v.exp_midpt_mjd, v.exp_time, v.sky_rotation,
   cv.detector, cv.s_region, v.s_ra, v.s_dec, v.science_program, v.target_n=
ame,
   v.img_type from cdb_lsstcam.ccdvisit1 as cv, cdb_lsstcam.visit1 as v
   where cv.visit_id=3Dv.visit_id and v.img_type=3D'science'
   and -50 &lt; v.s_dec and v.s_dec &lt; 24 and cv.detector &lt; 189
   and cv.detector not in (0, 20, 27, 65, 123, 161, 168, 188, 122, 169,
   187, 120, 158, 30, 68, 1, 19)</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"b3126ad2-1b4b-48a9-8e57-4b6bace57d0a">This selection yielded=
 22229 visits.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"6cfa7635-d584-47e5-ab2c-66e81fde2113" id=3D"DRPResourceUsag=
eEstimates-1.2.DR1">1.2. DR1</h2>
<p local-id=3D"31f7c5a4-2e38-4344-bf5d-f708cee30955">The inputs used for th=
ese calculations are the Y1 observations from the <a class=3D"external-link=
" href=3D"https://community.lsst.org/t/release-of-v5-0-simulations/11114" r=
el=3D"nofollow">baseline v5.0 simulations</a>, specifically, from the <code=
>baseline_v5.0.0_10yrs.db</code> opsim db file.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-674622223" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-674622223" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"03fbc5efaf4ce050065d09c80269f81b450c23=
8eb1ba92445e86c437c8e8a295" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">Storage by dataset type, no compression</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-674622223" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 local-id=3D"b810108384a2" id=3D"DRPResourceUsageEstimates-1.2.1.Storage=
bydatasettype,nocompression">1.2.1. Storage by dataset type, no compression=
</h3>
<p local-id=3D"94271192871b">These dataset sizes use mean sizes extracted f=
rom the <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://rubinobs.atlassian.net/b=
rowse/DM-52645" rel=3D"nofollow">DM-52645</a> processing and the <code>lsst=
_cells_v1</code> skymap.</p>
<p local-id=3D"4cb2289e7c5e">Here are the top 20 entries by dataset type, w=
hich add up to ~97% of the 52 PB total:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
